# Telegram integration
#
# The bot token is NOT part of the frontend any more. It lives only in the Cloudflare
# Worker (telegram-worker/) as the TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN secret; the app posts to Telegram
# through the Worker's /send route.
#
# Every request from the app to the Worker must carry the APP_KEY secret in the
# x-app-key header. Set it with `npx wrangler secret put APP_KEY` and enter the same
# value once in the app (key icon in the header). It is stored in the browser only.
#
# The Worker URL is hard-coded in src/services/api.ts (TELEGRAM_WORKER_URL).
